{
    "title": "Eye Makeup: Eye Looks Guide",
    "description": "Learn eye makeup in a simple and easy way, with a step-by-step tutorial and a complete guide for your everyday life.\r\n\r\nA well-produced makeup makes all the difference in the eyes, they are highlighted in our face and need care\r\n\r\nEye makeup can be simple, with mascara, eye pencil and even eye shadow, or more complete and professional eye makeup.\r\n\r\nEye makeup is a concern for many women, especially those just learning how to do makeup.\r\n\r\nIf you are a makeup beginner or want to improve your techniques, we will teach you how to apply makeup to your eyes, as well as tricks to make your look powerful and make up complete.\r\n\r\nIt doesn't matter if you have blue eyes, green eyes or brown eyes, you will learn how to do eye makeup and photo makeup, and with that, have your photo makeup displayed to everyone, with simple lessons, you can achieve it!\r\n\r\nBesides learning eye makeup, you'll also learn how to use eyeliner step by step, make eyeliner for pictures, apply eyeshadow, mascara, eyeliner, primer and much more!\r\n\r\nWe also know that the eye area is very sensitive and needs extra care, and hydrating the eyelids is an essential step to facilitate makeup application and should be part of your day-to-day care routine.\r\n\r\nBeautiful and elegant makeup doesn't have to be difficult to do, and often the simplest is the best choice. This guide will help you improve your makeup look.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Learn eye makeup in a simple and easy way, with a step-by-step tutorial and a complete guide for your everyday life.<br><br>A well-produced makeup makes all the difference in the eyes, they are highlighted in our face and need care<br><br>Eye makeup can be simple, with mascara, eye pencil and even eye shadow, or more complete and professional eye makeup.<br><br>Eye makeup is a concern for many women, especially those just learning how to do makeup.<br><br>If you are a makeup beginner or want to improve your techniques, we will teach you how to apply makeup to your eyes, as well as tricks to make your look powerful and make up complete.<br><br>It doesn&#39;t matter if you have blue eyes, green eyes or brown eyes, you will learn how to do eye makeup and photo makeup, and with that, have your photo makeup displayed to everyone, with simple lessons, you can achieve it!<br><br>Besides learning eye makeup, you&#39;ll also learn how to use eyeliner step by step, make eyeliner for pictures, apply eyeshadow, mascara, eyeliner, primer and much more!<br><br>We also know that the eye area is very sensitive and needs extra care, and hydrating the eyelids is an essential step to facilitate makeup application and should be part of your day-to-day care routine.<br><br>Beautiful and elegant makeup doesn&#39;t have to be difficult to do, and often the simplest is the best choice. This guide will help you improve your makeup look.",
    "summary": "Learn how to do eye makeup with simple lessons and step by step tutorial.",
